---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import settings from '../data/settings.json';

// Update this date whenever the wording below changes
const updated = '21 October 2026';
const email = settings.email;
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy & Legal"
	description={`How ${settings.businessName} handles your personal information, plus copyright and trademark notices.`}
>
	<PageHero eyebrow="Privacy & legal" title="Your privacy" intro={`Last updated ${updated}.`} />

	<section class="section">
		<div class="container legal">
			<nav class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
				<a href="#who">Who we are</a>
				<a href="#collect">What we collect</a>
				<a href="#use">How we use it</a>
				<a href="#share">Who we share it with</a>
				<a href="#keep">How long we keep it</a>
				<a href="#rights">Your rights</a>
				<a href="#cookies">Cookies</a>
				<a href="#copyright">Copyright &amp; trademarks</a>
			</nav>

			<div class="legal__body">
				<h2 id="who">Who we are</h2>
				<p>
					This website is run by {settings.businessName}, based in {settings.location}, {settings.region}, UK. We are the
					“controller” of any personal information you give us through this website, which means we decide how it’s used.
				</p>
				<p>
					If you have any questions about your information, email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> or call{' '}
					{settings.phone}.
				</p>

				<h2 id="collect">What we collect</h2>
				<p>We only collect what you choose to give us:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						<strong>Enquiry form:</strong> your name, email address, phone number, your dog’s name, breed and age, the
						course or service you’re interested in, and anything you write in your message.
					</li>
					<li><strong>Email, phone or WhatsApp:</strong> whatever you send when you contact us directly.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					We don’t use analytics or tracking on this website, and we don’t collect information about you automatically.
					Our web host keeps short-term technical logs (such as IP addresses) to keep the site secure and running; we
					don’t use these to identify you.
				</p>

				<h2 id="use">How we use it</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>To reply to your enquiry and arrange training, courses or home visits.</li>
					<li>To provide the training you’ve booked and support you between sessions.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					Under UK data protection law, our lawful bases are taking steps at your request before entering into an
					agreement with you, providing the service you’ve booked, and our legitimate interest in replying to messages
					sent to us. We never sell your information or use it for marketing without asking you first.
				</p>

				<h2 id="share">Who we share it with</h2>
				<p>We don’t share your information with anyone except the services that help us run the business:</p>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Web3Forms</strong> delivers enquiry form messages to our inbox.</li>
					<li><strong>Google (Gmail)</strong> stores our emails.</li>
					<li><strong>GitHub</strong> hosts this website.</li>
					<li>
						<strong>Bookwhen</strong> handles course bookings. When you book through Bookwhen, their own privacy policy
						applies as well as ours.
					</li>
					<li><strong>WhatsApp</strong> (Meta) carries messages if you choose to contact us that way.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					Some of these companies may store data outside the UK. They do so under safeguards recognised by UK data
					protection law. We may also share information if the law requires us to.
				</p>

				<h2 id="keep">How long we keep it</h2>
				<p>
					We keep enquiries for up to 12 months after our last contact, unless you become a client. For clients, we keep
					training records for as long as we’re working together and for up to 2 years afterwards, so we can pick up
					where we left off if you return. After that, we delete them.
				</p>

				<h2 id="rights">Your rights</h2>
				<p>You have the right to:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>ask for a copy of the information we hold about you</li>
					<li>ask us to correct anything that’s wrong</li>
					<li>ask us to delete your information</li>
					<li>object to, or ask us to limit, how we use it</li>
				</ul>
				<p>
					To do any of these, email <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. We’ll respond within one month. If you’re
					unhappy with how we’ve handled your information, you can complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office
					at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.
				</p>

				<h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
				<p>
					This website doesn’t use any cookies, so there’s nothing to accept or decline. If you follow a link to another
					site, such as Bookwhen, Google, WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram or TikTok, that site’s own cookie and privacy
					policies apply.
				</p>

				<h2 id="copyright">Copyright &amp; trademarks</h2>
				<p>
					© {new Date().getFullYear()} {settings.businessName}. The text, photos and design of this website belong to{' '}
					{settings.businessName} or are used with permission. Please don’t copy them without asking.
				</p>
				<p>
					Accreditation, partner and brand logos (including ABTC, The Canine Behaviour &amp; Training Society, UK Sniffer
					Dogs, Tracking Dogs UK, Perfect Fit and Tug-E-Nuff) are the trademarks of their respective owners and are shown
					to indicate membership, accreditation or partnership. Reviews are quoted from Google, with a link to the
					originals.
				</p>
				{settings.legalNotice && <p>{settings.legalNotice}</p>}
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.legal {
		display: grid;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		align-items: start;
	}
	@media (min-width: 940px) {
		.legal {
			grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
			gap: 4rem;
		}
		.toc {
			position: sticky;
			top: 140px;
		}
	}
	.toc {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.15rem;
		padding: 1rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--line);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		background: #fff;
	}
	.toc a {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: var(--navy);
		padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius);
	}
	.toc a:hover {
		background: var(--bone);
		color: var(--signal);
	}
	.legal__body {
		max-width: 68ch;
		font-size: 1.08rem;
		min-width: 0;
	}
	.legal__body h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2rem);
		margin: 2.4rem 0 0.7rem;
	}
	.legal__body h2:first-child {
		margin-top: 0;
	}
	.legal__body ul {
		padding-left: 1.2rem;
		margin: 0 0 1em;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.4rem;
	}
	.legal__body li::marker {
		color: var(--signal);
	}
	.legal__body a {
		color: var(--signal);
		font-weight: 600;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
		overflow-wrap: anywhere;
	}
</style>
